stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created
    Created --> Suspended: THRDCreate
    Suspended --> Runnable: THRDResume or MakeRun
    Runnable --> Running: selected by scheduler
    Running --> Runnable: quantum expires or thread yields
    Running --> Blocked: wait on object
    Running --> Sleeping: NKSleep or timed wait
    Blocked --> Runnable: object signaled or timeout path completes
    Sleeping --> Runnable: wakeup time reached
    Running --> Dying: NKExitThread or KillOneThread
    Dying --> Dead: final cleanup and removal
    Dead --> [*]
